      "description": "Calculate natal Vedic D1 Rasi and D9 Navamsa facts using Swiss Ephemeris planetary positions, an approximate linear Lahiri ayanamsa formula, and whole-sign houses. Requires verified birth date, time, coordinates, and IANA timezone. Interpretation is composed by ChatGPT. Combustion, dignities, yogas, Atmakaraka, and Darakaraka are unavailable. The chart handler does not save charts; service authentication, rate limits, and operational logs still apply. Interpretation is composed in the user's current host ChatGPT conversation. This connector makes no hosted inference calls.",
